 skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="about_hero_content"><div class="text-style-badge"><div class="badge-dot-wrapper"><div class="badge-dot"></div><div data-w-id="81035e8d-42be-25a5-a346-2dcd8a64c1f8" class="badge-shadow"></div></div><div>OM-eTrading </div></div><div class="spacer-small-company"></div><h1 class="heading-7"><strong class="bold-text-7-compani">OM</strong><strong><em class="italic-text-6">e</em></strong><strong class="bold-text-7-compani">T<br/>‍</strong>Built by the Market. </h1><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="text-size-small text-style-muted60">Institutional swap markets still rely on relationships, discretion, and manual workflow. <strong>OM</strong><strong><em>e</em></strong><strong>T</strong> is built to replace that model with rules-based execution that is anonymous, all-to-all, and directly connected to clearing from the moment a trade occurs.<br/><br/><strong>OM</strong><strong><em>e</em></strong><strong>T</strong> was built by market structure veterans with deep experience across OTC derivatives, execution workflow, clearing, and trading infrastructure. The inefficiencies that <strong>OM</strong><strong><em>e</em></strong><strong>T</strong> addresses are not theoretical. They are structural problems our team spent years navigating firsthand.</div><div class="spacer-small"></div></div><img class="about_hero_img hideweb" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe37254a9e5aa15f203f5c_RIGHT-BG-Co-01.avif" alt="Abstract globe with North and South America surrounded by swirling teal and orange curved lines on a light background." style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" sizes="100vw" data-w-id="7a925337-72d7-69e1-06b5-26ac102e7319" id="w-node-_7a925337-72d7-69e1-06b5-26ac102e7319-1176480c" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe37254a9e5aa15f203f5c_RIGHT-BG-Co-01-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe37254a9e5aa15f203f5c_RIGHT-BG-Co-01-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe37254a9e5aa15f203f5c_RIGHT-BG-Co-01-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe37254a9e5aa15f203f5c_RIGHT-BG-Co-01-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe37254a9e5aa15f203f5c_RIGHT-BG-Co-01-p-2000.avif 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe37254a9e5aa15f203f5c_RIGHT-BG-Co-01.avif 2048w"/></div></div></div></div><section class="section_about_mission"><div class="padding-section-medium padding-top"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-default pad-off"><div data-w-id="8acb98cd-d97f-6afa-155b-deeb668e1093" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="section-title"><div class="text-style-badge"><div class="badge-dot-wrapper"><div class="badge-dot"></div><div data-w-id="3713745d-2a86-4486-d537-6f66ec8a770d" class="badge-shadow"></div></div><div>Mission</div></div></div></div><div class="divider"></div><div class="container-default pad-off con-d-shad fgnn"><div class="about_mission_wrap"><div data-w-id="8acb98cd-d97f-6afa-155b-deeb668e109b" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="about_mission_left"><div data-w-id="53d17843-a834-e652-9d4e-8d2b27df19a3" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="about_mission_text-box"><h2 id="w-node-_8acb98cd-d97f-6afa-155b-deeb668e109c-1176480c" data-w-id="8acb98cd-d97f-6afa-155b-deeb668e109c" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="heading-style-h3">Our Mission</h2><div class="about_mission_text"><div class="heading-14 _14fix">To reduce information asymmetry and operational friction in cleared OTC derivatives markets through deterministic, anonymous execution infrastructure.<br/><br/>We believe all institutional participants should have access to liquidity through transparent, rules-based market structure without the structural disadvantages of legacy voice and RFQ workflow.</div></div><div id="w-node-_821bbf7b-c4e0-2563-2967-99790fc16e45-1176480c" class="about_mission_text fg"><div class="text-size-small text-style-muted60 ggh"><div class="text-block-5 adjustt6"><strong class="bold-text-20">Accessability</strong><br/><strong>‍</strong>Impartial access to all eligible participants.</div></div><div class="text-size-small text-style-muted60"><div class="text-block-5"><br/><strong class="bold-text-21">Anonymous </strong><br/>Anonymous execution designed to minimize information leakage based on deterministic price time trading protocol.</div></div><div class="text-size-small text-style-muted60"><div class="text-block-5"><strong class="bold-text-22">Transparency</strong><br/>Fair and equal access to market information.</div></div><div class="text-size-small text-style-muted60"><div class="text-block-5"><strong class="bold-text-23">Efficiency</strong><br/>Streamlined straight-through-processing and clearing.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="div-block-8 hide"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69f35fbb0ed4bfe985d03dda_VINAYEK.avif" loading="lazy" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" data-w-id="1eed2ffa-2ab8-3046-f0c5-5bb4f44a5fca" alt="Smiling middle-aged man with gray hair wearing a dark suit and white shirt against a blurred indoor background." class="image"/><div class="about_mission_author fixed"><div class="about_mission_authhor-name">Vinayek Singh</div><div class="text-size-small">Founder &amp; CEO</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="teem2" class="section_about_team"><div class="padding-section-medium padding-top"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-default fixc01"><div class="section-title"><div class="text-style-badge"><div class="badge-dot-wrapper"><div class="badge-dot"></div><div data-w-id="3713745d-2a86-4486-d537-6f66ec8a770d" class="badge-shadow"></div></div><div>Our team</div></div><div class="text-style-badge">03</div></div></div><div class="divider"></div><div class="container-default"><h2 class="heading-33">Proven Practitioners</h2><div class="spacer-medium fix"></div><h2 class="heading-14 _14fix"><strong>OM</strong><strong><em>e</em></strong><strong>T</strong>’s Market infrastructure is built by people who have experienced the market from the inside.</h2><div class="spacer-medium webhi"><h2 class="heading-14 _14fix"><strong>OM</strong><strong>e</strong><strong>T</strong>’s leadership team brings together expertise across execution, clearing, product design, and market systems engineering and sales. That combination matters because institutional market structure cannot be redesigned from the outside. It must be built by practitioners who understand where the current model breaks, why it persisted, and what a more durable structure requires.</h2></div><div class="spacer-medium webhi-copy-copy"><h2 class="heading-14 adjusthh2-copy-copy miss-copy">Management Team </h2></div><div class="teams-top-1 w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="teams-top-2 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="section_about_item shdd w-dyn-item"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd27a300b1e4313bac898/6a1d92f53f58d09a00c20bf7_V1-Final-May-29th.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-29"/><div class="about_team_content"><div><div class="text-size-medium"><div class="text-size-medium">Vinayek K. Singh</div><div class="text-size-medium text-style-muted">CEO</div></div></div><div class="about_team_social-links-evf"><a data-wf-native-id-path="e69bac19-9873-228