ut_item shdd w-dyn-item"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd27a300b1e4313bac898/6a1d9eb717b1f4a94bce2cd4_DAN-Final-04.avif" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-26"/><div class="about_team_content"><div><div class="text-size-medium">Daniel Mygan</div><div class="text-size-medium text-style-muted">Product Development</div><div class="text-size-medium text-style-muted"></div></div><div class="about_team_social-links allo"><a data-wf-native-id-path="36f96402-d56d-93be-02a4-12a2187378b7_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="36f96402-d56d-93be-02a4-12a2187378b7" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2269ff4a5d50d17ce966227147%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2269ff4b26139b3f66b598ab89%22%7D%5D" href="#" class="about_team_social-link-copy"></a><a data-wf-native-id-path="922623d6-ffc1-12e9-a1fc-3cb599d17574_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="922623d6-ffc1-12e9-a1fc-3cb599d17574" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2269ff4a5d50d17ce966227147%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2269ff4b26139b3f66b598ab89%22%7D%5D" href="mailto:d.mygan@om-etrading.com" class="link-4">d.mygan@om-etrading.com</a></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="36f96402-d56d-93be-02a4-12a2187378bb_instance-3" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="36f96402-d56d-93be-02a4-12a2187378bb" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2269ff4a5d50d17ce966227147%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2269ff4b26139b3f66b598ab89%22%7D%5D" href="/team-tech/daniel-mygan" class="readmore">Read More</a></div></div><div role="listitem" class="section_about_item shdd w-dyn-item"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd27a300b1e4313bac898/6aa9d02e3f6d40fbb0ebc1c1_Harshit-02.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd27a300b1e4313bac898/6aa9d02e3f6d40fbb0ebc1c1_Harshit-02-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd27a300b1e4313bac898/6aa9d02e3f6d40fbb0ebc1c1_Harshit-02-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd27a300b1e4313bac898/6aa9d02e3f6d40fbb0ebc1c1_Harshit-02-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd27a300b1e4313bac898/6aa9d02e3f6d40fbb0ebc1c1_Harshit-02-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd27a300b1e4313bac898/6aa9d02e3f6d40fbb0ebc1c1_Harshit-02.jpg 1682w" class="image-26"/><div class="about_team_content"><div><div class="text-size-medium">Harshit Singh</div><div class="text-size-medium text-style-muted">Project Manager - OMeT-i</div><div class="text-size-medium text-style-muted"></div></div><div class="about_team_social-links allo"><a data-wf-native-id-path="36f96402-d56d-93be-02a4-12a2187378b7_instance-4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="36f96402-d56d-93be-02a4-12a2187378b7" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2269ff4a5d50d17ce966227147%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa9d04d6f562c46dc1dc84a%22%7D%5D" href="#" class="about_team_social-link-copy"></a><a data-wf-native-id-path="922623d6-ffc1-12e9-a1fc-3cb599d17574_instance-4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="922623d6-ffc1-12e9-a1fc-3cb599d17574" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2269ff4a5d50d17ce966227147%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa9d04d6f562c46dc1dc84a%22%7D%5D" href="mailto:h.singh@om-etrading.com" class="link-4">h.singh@om-etrading.com</a></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="36f96402-d56d-93be-02a4-12a2187378bb_instance-4" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="36f96402-d56d-93be-02a4-12a2187378bb" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2269ff4a5d50d17ce966227147%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%226aa9d04d6f562c46dc1dc84a%22%7D%5D" href="/team-tech/harshit-singh" class="readmore">Read More</a></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium webhi"></div></div></div></div></section><section id="teem" class="section_about_team"><div class="padding-section-medium padding-top gabp"></div><div class="padding-global allcom"><div data-w-id="238b9f8f-7f52-1245-f05e-50327170eba0" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="container-default"><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h2 class="heading-14 _14fix"><strong>OM</strong><strong><em>e</em></strong><strong>T</strong>’s leadership team brings together expertise across execution, clearing, product design, and market systems engineering and sales. That combination matters because institutional market structure cannot be redesigned from the outside. <br/>It must be built by practitioners who understand where the current model breaks, why it persisted, and what a more durable structure requires.</h2><div class="spacer-medium webhi-copy"></div></div><div data-w-id="e32bee98-47af-2a21-9bf9-f49820bebb27" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="container-default"><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h2 class="heading-14 _14fix">Empowering participants through transparent, rules-based market structure.<strong><br/><br/>The OM</strong><strong><em>e</em></strong><strong>T Approach<br/><br/></strong><strong>OM<em>e</em>T</strong> exists to give institutional participants a better execution environment: one defined by rules instead of discretion, structure instead of fragmentation, and transparency instead of negotiated opacity.We have built an infrastructure for a market that increasingly requires fairness, accessibility, transparency, auditability and better execution quality at scale.</h2><div class="spacer-medium fgix"></div></div></div></section><div class="padding-global"><div data-w-id="2a7783b7-84f8-59cc-7113-4a6d5c60ed5e" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1.5rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="container-default add-on"><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h2><strong class="eco">The OMeT Ecosystem</strong></h2><div class="spacer-medium fixg"></div><h2 class="heading-14 _14fix"><strong>OM</strong><strong><em>e</em></strong><strong>T</strong> is built to work within the institutional infrastructure the market already trusts. Our ecosystem is designed to support secure execution, post-trade continuity, and integration with critical workflow and clearing partners.</h2><div class="spacer-medium fixg-copy"></div><div class="features2_hero_highlights web5"><div id="w-node-_2a7783b7-84f8-59cc-7113-4a6d5c60ed64-1176480c" class="features2_hero_highlights-item-eco"><div class="icon-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fcdda9741a93233bb955da_Icon-61.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-height-medium"/></div><div class="text-size-medium vb6"><strong class="bold-text-12-copy">Credit Limit Control<br/></strong>OSTTRA / LimitHub</div></div><div id="w-node-_2a7783b7-84f8-59cc-7113-4a6d5c60ed69-1176480c" class="features2_hero_highlights-item-eco"><div class="icon-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fcdda9741a93233bb955da_Icon-61.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-height-medium"/></div><div class="text-size-medium vb6"><strong class="bold-text-12-copy">STP Workflow</strong>OSTTRA / MarkitWire</div></div><div class="features2_hero_highlights-item-eco"><div class="icon-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fcdda9741a93233bb955da_Icon-61.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-height-medium"/></div><div class="text-size-medium vb6"><strong class="bold-text-12-copy">Clearing</strong>CME / Asigna / LCH</div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium fixg-copy"></div><h2 class="heading-14 _14fix">By integrating with established institutional providers, <strong>OM</strong><strong><em>e</em></strong><strong>T</strong> is designed to fit into today&#x27;s ecosystem. </h2></div></div><section class="section_home2_banner"><div class="padding-section-medium padding-top"><div class="padding-global"><div class="divider"></div><div class="container-default"><div data-w-id="96bc8e91-1cfb-10d5-bb2d-ceb0569db258" class="home2_banner_wrap cc-adjust"><div class="layer-gradient-2"></div><div class="radial-gradient"></div><div data-w-id="96bc8e91-1cfb-10d5-bb2d-ceb0569db25b" class="layer-tile"></div><div data-w-id="96bc8e91-1cfb-10d5-bb2d-ceb0569db25c" class="noise"></div><div class="padding-section-medium"><div class="home2_banner_grid"><div data-w-id="96bc8e91-1cfb-10d5-bb2d-ceb0569db25f" class="home2_banner_left"><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe48d56766c689a1bc291d_OMET%20Icon%20004%400.5x-8.png" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe48d56766c689a1bc291d_OMET%20Icon%20004%400.5x-8-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe48d56766c689a1bc291d_OMET%20Icon%20004%400.5x-8-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe48d56766c689a1bc291d_OMET%20Icon%20004%400.5x-8-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69fe48d56766c689a1bc291d_OMET%20Icon%20004%400.5x-8.png 1464w" alt="OM e-Trading logo with white circular brushstroke on green gradient background." class="image-21"/></div><div class="spacer-tiny"></div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="spacer-medium webf"></div></div><div id="w-node-bbcfa6c4-8850-cb12-761f-9a9a1b03776e-569db24f"><div class="text-block-11"><strong>Architected by Institutional Veterans<br/><br/>‍</strong>“<strong>OM</strong><strong><em>e</em></strong><strong>T </strong>was built from a simple conviction: capital markets cannot continue to rely on antiquated execution models if they are expected to deliver fairness, efficiency, and transparency at scale. We are building the infrastructure for a more anonymous, more deterministic, and more structurally sound future.”<br/><br/>‍<strong>Vinayek Singh<br/>‍</strong>Chief Executive Officer</div><div class="button-group-copy"><a data-wf-native-id-path="59a2905a-c7cc-a72e-733e-db495ed6f834:45f3a675-ceda-8cb1-e46c-fe473017cb80:e7f6f2e4-b4e5-f9b9-0cd7-c32a64834558" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="e7f6f2e4-b4e5-f9b9-0cd7-c32a64834558" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%2296bc8e91-1cfb-10d5-bb2d-ceb0569db24f%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%2259a2905a-c7cc-a72e-733e-db495ed6f834%22%7D%2C%7B%22componentId%22%3A%22e7f6f2e4-b4e5-f9b9-0cd7-c32a64834558%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%2245f3a675-ceda-8cb1-e46c-fe473017cb80%22%7D%5D" href="/contact-v2-omet" class="button w-inline-block"><div>Request a Walkthrough</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69ebd279300b1e4313bac81a/69ebd27a300b1e4313baca04_Arrow%20-%20Right%202.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="icon-height-small"/></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="footer"><div class="footer-gradient"></div><div data-w-id="8fb3dbc6-8392-5b83-3871-3f269f2dcad8" class="layer-tile tile-off"></